//! Shipped v1.71 RAM layout of the `Lxr` globals (non-C helper, group P3).
//!
//! Generated by `gen_shipped_layout.py` from `lxr_core::cmem::GLOBALS` (reference ELF addresses and
//! sizes) and the recovered symbol map of the shipped image (`crates/lxr-emu/data/v1.71_symbols.json`;
//! `chokeCurrent` / `chokeNext` from the literal pool of the shipped `seq_processFlam.part.0`). `Lxr`
//! stores C pointers as reference-ELF addresses (`CPtr`); where the firmware modifies the bytes of a
//! stored pointer (out-of-range stores), the shipped result is reproduced by doing the byte arithmetic on
//! the shipped address (`to_shipped` / `from_shipped`).
